        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: builds stop hanging on stalled plugin asset hooks",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where local builds, source CLI rebuilds, macOS restarts, Docker builds, CI, or release jobs could hang indefinitely when a bundled plugin asset build or copy hook stalled.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nEach plugin-owned asset hook now has a 10-minute deadline, matching existing build and release command ceilings. Asset hooks remain shell command strings, so the deadline runs through the repository's managed-child owner: a detached process group on POSIX and `taskkill /T /F` on Windows. Timeout cleanup therefore terminates the shell and its descendants instead of only the shell leader. Timeout errors identify only the phase and plugin id, without forwarding child error details.\n\n## User Impact\n\nDevelopers and release operators now get a bounded, actionable failure instead of an indefinitely blocked build or a timeout that leaves plugin work running in the background. Successful Browser, Canvas, Diffs, and Discord asset generation keeps the existing commands and output behavior.\n\n## Evidence\n\nExact head: `5b3769f55bc99307837f1804df069b39474b7988`\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs test/scripts/bundled-plugin-assets.test.ts test/scripts/managed-child-process.test.ts` — 18/18 passed. These tests run real child trees: the asset-hook regression starts a shell-owned launcher plus a descendant that ignores `SIGTERM`, and the shared managed-child regression verifies both parent and descendant are gone after the deadline. Existing Windows coverage verifies timeout cleanup's tree primitive uses `taskkill /T /F`.\n\n```text\nTest Files  2 passed (2)\n     Tests  18 passed (18)\n  Duration  2.60s (transform 271ms, setup 79ms, import 254ms, tests 1.97s, environment 0ms)\n[test] passed 1 Vitest shard in 10.31s\n```\n\n- Real successful path on the exact head: `node scripts/bundled-plugin-assets.mjs --phase build --plugin discord` completed successfully; generated SDK SHA-256: `72a78cd678dada982e7109aa31488f1c7cd85ad76e933e0d080a0bd9cf6ac6c7`.\n- `oxfmt --check scripts/bundled-plugin-assets.mjs scripts/lib/managed-child-process.mjs test/scripts/bundled-plugin-assets.test.ts test/scripts/managed-child-process.test.ts` — passed.\n- Targeted Oxlint for the four changed files passed with the pre-existing `typescript/require-array-sort-compare` diagnostic on the unchanged alias-sort line allowed for this focused run.\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` — passed.\n- `node scripts/check-changed.mjs --dry-run` selects the expected `testRoot` and `tooling` lanes. Exact-head GitHub CI supplies the clean-install full-lane proof.\n",
        "branch": "fix/bundled-plugin-assets-deadline",
